SF-WHOSON v1.0 - Spitfire node poller
Shows live who's-online status for
your Spitfire BBS nodes by reading
SFWHOSON.DAT and SFUSERS.PTR. No
login or remote desktop needed.
Auto-refreshing console display.
Python 3, config via simple .ini.
Includes full setup instructions.
by Xbit / X-Bit Operations
